00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.710
Sorry I used so much gas, Dad.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.070
It's okay, Ubuntu.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:56.050
What's important is that you feel guilty about it.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:08.430
- A vegan dinner for my grandson's birthday?

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.610
You deserve steaks and strippers.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:12.510
Come on, Ubuntu, I'm buying.

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:13.670
- Meat's murder.

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.470
- No, son, meat is yummy.

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:16.670
Come on, let's roll.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.530
I got nine extra seats in the SUV

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:19.860
if you want to stretch out.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:21.610
- Where do I begin, Dad?

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:25.350
- Ah, okay, happy birthday.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.000
Sayonara.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.830
- Well then, that leaves an extra veggie roll for Che.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.920
Chey? Here, boy. Where is Chey?

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.270
Hot hair!

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.270
Okay...

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.780
Hot hair!

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:43.780
Stupid!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.780
Stupid!

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:48.840
Hot hair!

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:52.880
No, it's all wrong!
